{"data":{"id":"AHXyNwIcMSM","slug":"pharrell-and-the-yessirs","title":"Pharrell & The Yessirs","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"f8FBUecIf5c","slug":"that-girl-feat-snoop-dogg-and-charlie-wilson","title":"That Girl (feat. Snoop Dogg & Charlie Wilson)"},{"id":"6Y30ttyNDCU","slug":"take-it-off","title":"Take It Off"},{"id":"Aog0ejLem54","slug":"you-can-do-it-too-f-jamie-cullum","title":"You Can Do It Too f Jamie Cullum"},{"id":"v5YPe6IQrjI","slug":"that-girl-f-snoop-dogg-and-charlie-wilson","title":"That Girl f. Snoop Dogg & Charlie Wilson"},{"id":"BCEoAr3KF5k","slug":"number-1-ft-kanye-west","title":"Number 1 ft. Kanye West"}]},"markers":[{"id":"zBtecWplJCs","position":47,"timestamp":"01:28:41","rawTrack":"Pharrell & The Yessirs - That Girl (feat. Snoop Dogg & Charlie Wilson)","track":{"id":"f8FBUecIf5c","path":"/artists/pharrell-the-yessirs/tracks/that-girl-feat-snoop-dogg-charlie-wilson/","slug":"that-girl-feat-snoop-dogg-and-charlie-wilson","title":"That Girl (feat. Snoop Dogg & Charlie Wilson)","artist":{"slug":"pharrell-and-the-yessirs","title":"Pharrell & The Yessirs"},"artwork":"images/artists/pharrell-the-yessirs/tracks/that-girl-feat-snoop-dogg-charlie-wilson.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"LtuDGAULHy0","slug":"541","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-541/ra.1612720787","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-541"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #541","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-541.jpg","content":"Music from Lucky Daye, Dylan Sinclair, and BINA.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-03-12T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"_yBAsb2EvfQ","position":18,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Pharrell & The Yessirs - Take It Off","track":{"id":"6Y30ttyNDCU","path":"/artists/pharrell-the-yessirs/tracks/take-it-off/","slug":"take-it-off","title":"Take It Off","artist":{"slug":"pharrell-and-the-yessirs","title":"Pharrell & The Yessirs"},"artwork":"images/artists/pharrell-the-yessirs/tracks/take-it-off.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"PQcEHD74TwM","slug":"141","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-141-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #141 w/ Colta (Team Supreme)","artwork":"/images/episodes/141.jpg","content":"\nColta from Team Supreme drops a set to promote the (Team Supreme x Soulection Takeover @ The Echo)\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10821,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-17T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"wvijlzJn5yk","position":2,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Pharrell & The Yessirs - That Girl f. Snoop Dogg & Charlie Wilson","track":{"id":"v5YPe6IQrjI","path":"/artists/pharrell-the-yessirs/tracks/that-girl-f-snoop-dogg-charlie-wilson/","slug":"that-girl-f-snoop-dogg-and-charlie-wilson","title":"That Girl f. Snoop Dogg & Charlie Wilson","artist":{"slug":"pharrell-and-the-yessirs","title":"Pharrell & The Yessirs"},"artwork":"images/artists/pharrell-the-yessirs/tracks/that-girl-f-snoop-dogg-charlie-wilson.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"9vaV0x1cIVc","slug":"152","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-152-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #152 w/ LIKE (Pac Div)","artwork":"/images/episodes/152.jpg","content":"\n\nDue to all the adversity we went through with this show we had [LIKE](https://soundcloud.com/callmelike) play music past the last hour and extend all the way for a total of 3 hours & 39 minutes. \n<!--more-->\n\nFrom the very first minute to the very end we were providing music that you never heard of or forgot about, configuring wires, figuring out audio issues, chopping it up about food, you name it. So much effort went into producing this show. We want to thank our brother LIKE for rolling through and blessing us with a proper DJ set, freestyle over Esta's beat, and talking to us about his experiences growing up and being in Pac Div. This man has traveled the world, played alongside the best in the game, and has also produced for/with the best (Kendrick, The Neptunes, ect). Joe Kay made sure to touch on topics that are very insightful. LIKE will be releasing with us on Soulection so stay tuned! \n\nFollow LIKE on [Twitter](https://twitter.com/Callmelike) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/clearlyitslike/) | [Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/callmeLike/)\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":13189,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-16T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"s1Plw5ZxtQw","position":80,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Pharrell & The Yessirs - Take It Off","track":{"id":"6Y30ttyNDCU","path":"/artists/pharrell-the-yessirs/tracks/take-it-off/","slug":"take-it-off","title":"Take It Off","artist":{"slug":"pharrell-and-the-yessirs","title":"Pharrell & The Yessirs"},"artwork":"images/artists/pharrell-the-yessirs/tracks/take-it-off.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"KGbt4wCudfQ","slug":"168","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-168-sxsw"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #168 (SXSW Pre Show)","artwork":"/images/episodes/168.jpg","content":"Joe kay getting you ready for SXSW.\n<!--more-->\n\nAs we are getting ready for SXSW we wanted to get you in the spirit. Joe Kay went solo again to keep things simple and focused. He kicked it off with the new Carmack/Esta collab, played some new discoveries/unreleased gems, and then switched up the whole format by letting the live listener selects the music by sending us our requests via our social media networks. What a beautiful thing! For over 2 hours, you had the chance to selects the music, Joe was just the provider! What a great way to collaborate right? Since we will be at SXSW from (March 11-16) there won't be a live Soulection Radio show next week, however, we do have a special guest mix to make up for it. Stay tuned.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10818,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-03-08T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"i5V89ofjocI","position":20,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Pharrell & The Yessirs - Number 1 ft. Kanye West","track":{"id":"BCEoAr3KF5k","path":"/artists/pharrell-the-yessirs/tracks/number-1-ft-kanye-west/","slug":"number-1-ft-kanye-west","title":"Number 1 ft. Kanye West","artist":{"slug":"pharrell-and-the-yessirs","title":"Pharrell & The Yessirs"},"artwork":"images/artists/pharrell-the-yessirs/tracks/number-1-ft-kanye-west.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"HDFgu5UTRf4","slug":"182","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-182-w-ta-ku"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #182 w/ Ta-ku","artwork":"/images/episodes/182.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10849,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-08-09T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set (0 - 52:46:00)","position":0}},{"id":"hoIk-Za1imo","position":8,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Pharrell & The Yessirs - You Can Do It Too f Jamie Cullum","track":{"id":"Aog0ejLem54","path":"/artists/pharrell-the-yessirs/tracks/you-can-do-it-too-f-jamie-cullum/","slug":"you-can-do-it-too-f-jamie-cullum","title":"You Can Do It Too f Jamie Cullum","artist":{"slug":"pharrell-and-the-yessirs","title":"Pharrell & The Yessirs"},"artwork":"images/artists/pharrell-the-yessirs/tracks/you-can-do-it-too-f-jamie-cullum.jp